    "transcript" : "# October workshop\n\nSix people, hand-building, two hours. Mariam is bringing two friends from her office.\n\n## Before\n\nClean the bike side on Friday night. Cover the stands. #studio #workshop\n\n## Materials\n\nTwo bags of the grey body, slip, the small wooden ribs. Check we have enough boards — last time we ran out.\n\n## After\n\nDry a week, bisque, then invite everyone back to glaze. That second evening is the part people remember.\n\n### Open\n\nPrice? Rose says €45, Lotte says €60. Somewhere in between.",
